{"c":[{"id":"61095e0524be7bd8","sum":"LFS deploy. STL raw.githubusercontent.com; photos media.githubusercontent.com; img/. PGJ19 IEC 60061-1-2014 230-232; socket 60061-2-2017 197-199; H8 GOST R 41.37-99 p.91; standartgost.ru/g/<GOST>.pdf. Photo=docs. Deploy from main+tag; tag workflow old. CF 1010 bans Python-urllib.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"c5904169704ec79b","sum":"LFS (.gitattributes; lfs install; deploy lfs:true). STL raw.githubusercontent.com; photos media.githubusercontent.com; img/ only. PGJ19 cap IEC 60061-1-2014 230-232; socket 60061-2-2017 197-199; H8 GOST R 41.37-99 p.91. standartgost.ru/g/<GOST>.pdf→files.stroyinf.ru; unece 403.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"2a020576d04e892c","sum":"Images are Git LFS (.gitattributes; git lfs install; deploy checkout lfs:true). Cults createCreation takes public fileUrls and imageUrls: tag STLs from raw.githubusercontent.com, listing photos from media.githubusercontent.com.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261014T203950Z-eff7ad9401960c55","text":"Git LFS: .gitattributes for image extensions; git lfs install; Cults deploy workflow checkout lfs:true.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261014T213851Z-ae04b5b824e9273d","text":"Cults createCreation takes public fileUrls and imageUrls. This public repo's STL bytes are at raw.githubusercontent.com for a tag. Listing photos are Git LFS, so their URLs use media.githubusercontent.com.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"52ffa7beb384b17a","sum":"Listing photos are a model's img/ files; publish.yaml has no second image list. PGJ19 cap: GOST IEC 60061-1-2014 pp.230-232; socket: 60061-2-2017 pp.197-199; H8 outline: GOST R 41.37-99 p.91. standartgost.ru/g/<GOST>.pdf goes to files.stroyinf.ru; unece.org 403s curl.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261014T221030Z-54515ff6a680ce0d","text":"Listing photos are the files in a model's img/ directory. publish.yaml images is not a second copy of that folder.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261014T222523Z-e2e9f94954b895fe","text":"Standards PDFs with drawings: standartgost.ru/g/<GOST>.pdf redirects to files.stroyinf.ru (curl works). PGJ19 (H8/H9/H11 cap) is GOST IEC 60061-1-2014 pp.230-232, its socket GOST IEC 60061-2-2017 pp.197-199. unece.org 403s curl; GOST R 41.37-99 p.91 has the H8 outline.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3f99ebeae258c554","sum":"Photo commit is docs (squash uses the PR title; PR 5). summem start is silent on success. Manual Cults deploy: Run workflow from main with the tag; the tag's workflow is the old publisher. Cloudflare 1010 bans Python-urllib, which urllib adds only when User-Agent is absent.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5d8b1ecf1cb814b3","sum":"Photo commit is docs, on purpose, so each touched model gets a patch. Do not retitle it chore: squash-merge uses the PR title (PR 5). summem start prints nothing on success.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261014T234325Z-e518d920c8d024cd","text":"Photo commit is docs: add the listing photos on purpose, so both models get a patch. Do not retitle it chore. PR 5 title is docs because squash-merge uses the title.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261014T234953Z-bb4b30c459bcd561","text":"Add-a-model checklist (AGENTS.md) omits two things the existing models have: a one-paragraph AGENTS.md in the model dir and a row in the root README table. summem start prints nothing on success.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8a99568c23832ec8","sum":"Manual Cults deploy: Run workflow from main with the tag input; the tag's workflow is the old publisher. Cloudflare 1010 bans Python-urllib. urllib adds that agent only when User-Agent is absent.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261015T152556Z-fb44e9caeb21c926","text":"Manual Cults deploy must be Run workflow from main with the tag input. The tag's own workflow is the old publisher. Cloudflare 1010 bans the Python-urllib user agent.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T153626Z-85599dbb6e39046d","text":"A Cults user-agent test must require the header. urllib adds Python-urllib only when User-Agent is absent, so scanning the headers you set stays green.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"599e36dba16306f4","sum":"AGENTS.md on add-a-model. README lists no models. section(z) follows normal. Circles; cones 0.2. Main after a photographed print. Free elsewhere stays free. Two-model commits hit both changelogs. Match creation-time slug; version in description or blank id opens a second listing.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"8ad2a830a02e02b3","sum":"Model AGENTS.md is on the add-a-model checklist; root README lists no models; don't test Cults User-Agent. CadQuery section(z) follows workplane normal (XZ revolve slices along y). Use true circles, not Shapely polylines; offset touching cones 0.2.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"8d80c56c1ac8210e","sum":"Add-a-model checklist includes model AGENTS.md; root README lists no models. Do not test Cults User-Agent (change detector).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261015T154954Z-18a69cbe885816c7","text":"Supersedes the checklist-gap note: the Add-a-model checklist now has the model AGENTS.md step. The root README lists no models on purpose; the directories are the list.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T155147Z-711ba3dd8db79ebf","text":"Do not test the Cults User-Agent string. Asserting the header, or that Python-urllib is absent, is a change detector.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"82b21961bd137392","sum":"CadQuery: Workplane.section(z) follows the workplane normal (an XZ revolve slices along y); an area at height z is a thin slab. Shapely polylines bloat STEP and coincident cones are invalid; use true circles and offset touching cones by 0.2.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261015T175712Z-186d790bde4ed5d2","text":"CadQuery: Workplane.section(z) slices along the normal of the workplane the solid came from (a revolve on XZ slices along y). To get an area at height z, intersect a thin slab.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T175712Z-8a9b068da52fc102","text":"CadQuery: shapes from shapely polylines bloat STEP (4 MB vs 320 KB) and coincident cones make invalid solids; build from true circles and offset touching cones by 0.2.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"fd8eacd00eaeefe5","sum":"Main only after a photographed print; release publishes to Cults. v6.1: GitHub links OK; free elsewhere stays free; exclusivity is featuring only. Two-model commits hit both changelogs. Match the creation-time slug; version in the description, or blank id opens a second listing.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"31c37213a50ce3af","sum":"Land a model on main only after a verified, photographed test print; a release publishes to Cults. Cults terms v6.1: profile and markdown may link GitHub; Cults may zero a paid price if the file is free elsewhere; selling that is abuse; exclusivity affects featuring only.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261015T180306Z-e51cb22495956e9b","text":"Iterate a model on its own branch; land on main only after a test print is verified and photographed, since a release on main now publishes to Cults.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T191113Z-ec972aef108162fe","text":"Cults terms v6.1 (2026-03-31, French controls): profile and markdown descriptions may link GitHub. Cults may zero a paid price if the same file is free elsewhere. Selling a free-elsewhere file is abuse. Exclusivity affects featuring only.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"e1ad9944f3840761","sum":"Commit touching two models lands in both changelogs. Cults URL tail is the creation-time title slug; a later title can diverge. Publisher matches the exact name, so a versioned title with a blank cults_creation_id opens a second listing. Keep the version in the description.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261015T191156Z-0211d6cf5f5b64a4","text":"A squash that touches two model directories gives both packages one changelog line: release-please reads only the subject.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T191626Z-f508cfadc22886dc","text":"Cults URL last segment is a slug of the title at creation. A later title can diverge from that slug. Publisher matches the exact name, so a versioned title with a blank cults_creation_id opens a second listing. Put the version in the description.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
